WEBVTT

00:06:59.757 --> 00:07:01.853
he said that New York was projected

00:07:01.853 --> 00:07:04.910
to grow from eight to nine million people.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.440
And he asked me,

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.283
"So where are you going to put

00:07:08.283 --> 00:07:10.999
one million additional New Yorkers?"

00:07:10.999 --> 00:07:13.644
Well, I didn't have any idea.

00:07:13.644 --> 00:07:16.683
Now, you know that New York does

00:07:16.683 --> 00:07:19.381
place a high value on attracting immigrants,

00:07:19.381 --> 00:07:22.301
so we were excited about the prospect of growth,

00:07:22.301 --> 00:07:25.180
but honestly, where were we going to grow

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:28.574
in a city that was already built out to its edges

00:07:28.574 --> 00:07:31.374
and surrounded by water?